<div id="forBuyers">
    <h3>For Buyers</h3>
    <p class="fs-5">Welcome to our helpful guide, where you'll discover everything you need to know
        about
        browsing, searching, and purchasing books on our website. Whether you're new to online book
        shopping or have some questions along the way, this section is here to assist you every step
        of the journey. Find clear instructions, and answers to common queries related
        to the buying process. We want to ensure that your book-buying experience is smooth,
        enjoyable, and hassle-free. Let us be your trusted companion as you explore, order, and
        complete your purchase.
    </p>
</div>
<div id="how2buy">
    <h3>How To Buy?</h3>
    <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mt-2 mb-3">
        <p class="fs-5">Buying books is a breeze on our website! Simply head over to the <a
                href="/books">Books</a> page and you have two options:</p>
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            Buy Now: Clicking on this button will instantly redirect you to the order placement
            page.
            It's a quick and seamless way to complete your purchase.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            Add to Cart: If you want to explore more books before making a decision, you can add
            them
            to your cart. Just look for the cart icon on the navigation bar and click on it. You'll
            be
            taken to your cart, where you can review your selected books and even modify the
            quantities.
            Once you're satisfied with your choices, simply click on the "Place Order" button at the
            bottom of the page. This will redirect you to the final order placement page, where you
            can
            provide the necessary details to complete your order.
        </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="fs-5">
        We've designed our process to be user-friendly and efficient, ensuring a smooth and
        enjoyable book-buying experience for you. Happy shopping!
    </p>
</div>
<div id="how2order">
    <h3>How To Place Order?</h3>

    <p class="fs-5">
        Before placing an order, we kindly ask you to log in to your account. If you already have an
        account, simply log in. If you're new here, don't worry! Signing up is quick and easy.
    </p>
    <h5>Address</h5>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you're redirected to the order placement page, things become even more convenient. If
        you've previously saved an address, you can simply choose it from the list for hassle-free
        delivery. Don't worry if you haven't saved any address yet! Just fill in the necessary
        details, and we'll save it for you. This way, you won't have to re-enter your address every
        time you place an order.
    </p>
    <h5>Payment</h5>
    <p class="fs-5">

        Once you've confirmed your address, you'll be directed to the payment page. At the moment,
        we don't have a dedicated payment aggregator, so we manually verify payments and process
        refunds. We understand that this may take some time, but we kindly ask for your patience
        throughout the process.
        <br>
        To make a payment, you have two convenient options: 
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mt-2 mb-3">
            <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
                You can either use the UPI ID provided
            </li>
            <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
                Or scan the QR code. Choose the method that suits you best.
            </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="fs-5">
            After making the payment, please
            upload your payment receipt and click on the "Place Order" button.
        </p>
    </p>
    <h5>Place Order</h5>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Your order will be marked as "under processing" until we successfully verify your
        payment. Rest assured, we're working diligently to arrange and deliver your books to your
        address within 3 days.
        <p class="fs-5">
            In case you encounter any issues during the payment process, please don't hesitate to
            contact us. We're here to assist you and ensure a smooth payment experience.
        </p>
        <p class="fs-5">
            Thank you for your understanding and cooperation. We appreciate your trust in us, and we're
            excited to bring you your books in a timely manner!
        </p>
    </p>

    <p class="fs-5">
        We've designed our website with your convenience in mind, ensuring a user-friendly
        experience from start to finish. Get ready to enjoy a seamless ordering process with us!
    </p>
</div>
