    <p class="fs-5">
        Accessing your account is a breeze. Just click on the user icon on the navbar, and a
        friendly sidebar will appear. From there, click on the <a href="/user/dashboard">Your Dashboard</a> button, and you'll
        be redirected to your personal dashboard. In your dashboard, you can manage your account
        details, view your orders, and conveniently access your saved addresses.
    </p>
